ly. That is a third-party aggregator, not an official Yurika or Queensland Government source. Confirm the rate in the Chargefox app before relying on it."],"durationSeconds":5.270093694000001,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WbfaBYHpBgRT4SokHeUKtG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
